data: {"id": "d78d9c8d98874307-thinking-parallel_evidence-1178", "run_id": "d78d9c8d98874307", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据上游层的信息，Pod `workload-79d9f8fd88-bsn84` 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，直接原因为 OOMKilled (exit code 137) 和 Liveness Probe 失败 (HTTP 500)。\n\n当前需要验证的候选原因是 **\"CrashLoopBackOffRuntime 的直接原因待验证\"**。\n\n基于上下文归档中的摘要：\n1.  **OOMKilled 证据**：上一次容器状态终止退出码为 137，通常意味着被 OOM Killer 杀掉。\n2.  **资源限制**：Container 内存限制为 96Mi。\n3.  **Liveness Probe 失败**：kubelet 报告 Liveness Probe 返回 500，导致 kubelet 重启容器。\n4.  **CrashLoopBackOff**：由于容器不断重启并失败，Kubernetes 进入 Back-off 阶段。\n\n为了确认根因是 **OOMKilled** 导致服务无法响应从而 **Liveness Probe 失败**，还是 **Livenes", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789095764991, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

